			<item>
				<title>Short URL in your GWT project</title>
				<link>https://wlsc.de/posts/2016-04-21-short-url-in-your-gwt-project/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 21 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://wlsc.de/posts/2016-04-21-short-url-in-your-gwt-project/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you are struggling with a long URL in the GWT project, you are at the right place! There is a small trick, which&#xA;allows URL to be shorter.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;url-transformation&#34;&gt;&#xA;  URL Transformation&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#url-transformation&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;https://domain.com/tomcat_context_path/project_name/your_index.html&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;https://domain.com/tomcat_context_path/&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Launching GWT app in SuperDevMode on local Tomcat server</title>
				<link>https://wlsc.de/posts/2015-10-03-launching-gwt-app-in-superdevmode-on-local-tomcat-server/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://wlsc.de/posts/2015-10-03-launching-gwt-app-in-superdevmode-on-local-tomcat-server/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This article is dedicated to all people who are still developing on internal Jetty server and do not know how to run&#xA;their product on &lt;a href=&#34;http://tomcat.apache.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Apache Tomcat server&lt;/a&gt;. This guide is valid for *&#xA;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.eclipse.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Eclipse IDE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;* (Currently: v4.5 MARS).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;First of all, if you are not familiar with &lt;strong&gt;SuperDevMode&lt;/strong&gt; and its prerequisites, please check the official docs&#xA;at &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.gwtproject.org/articles/superdevmode.html&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;http://www.gwtproject.org&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
